  "title": "How Spring Valley Fire Is Saving Time and Staying Ready",
  "summary": "Across the United States, thousands of volunteer fire departments answer emergency calls for service every day. These departments protect their communities with firefighters who balance emergency response alongside full-time jobs, family responsibilities, and everything else that comes with daily life. Yet they face the same reporting requirements, training demands, and operational responsibilities as any career department. The Spring Valley Fire Department in New York is one of those...",
